Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.80,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,De vez em quando, eu me lembro daquela luta de espadas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Naquele dia,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.43,0:00:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,eu perdi a minha resposta e, ao mesmo tempo, a encontrei.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.67,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nem uma única coisa mudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.03,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele continua sendo ele, e eu continuo sendo eu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Apenas as memórias se desvanecem.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.31,0:00:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nenhum de nós acreditava que algo mudaria como resultado daquela batalha.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.47,0:00:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dois anos se passaram
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,desde que enfrentei o meu próprio ideal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.42,0:00:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou receber uma resposta pronta,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,for a long, long time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:15.48,Sign-EpTitle,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs48\fsp0.75\alpha&HF4&\t(29,279,\alpha&H60&)\xbord0.9\ybord1.5\blur2.25\t(3822,4323,0.9,\alpha&HFA&)\c&H000000&\fscx92\fscy100\pos(1301.7,1009.002)}Epílogo
