Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.44,0:01:15.60,Default,,0,600,0,,{\pos(624,1042)}Thanks for always being so considerate.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.60,0:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've told you a million times that I can manage without breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.11,0:01:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're allowing me to live here,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.84,0:01:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's the least I can do as your attendant.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.79,0:01:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still not a morning person, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.21,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Having at least one little quirk like that
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,gives a girl some charm, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.11,0:01:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Schedule-wise,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.52,0:01:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a special lecture on cutting in mineralogy today.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.92,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just have core subjects all morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're together half the day.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.38,0:02:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet at our usual spot this afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, never mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.71,0:02:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know that person?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.71,0:02:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we've just walked by each other a few times.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.29,0:02:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.05,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a bit belated, but it just hit me how strange this is.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.27,0:02:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is an outsider like me being allowed to study magic at a place like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, you aren't an outsider.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.57,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you Clock Tower's rules, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're a noted mage's rightful heir,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you're always at risk of having others try to kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.94,0:03:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that, a mage has the right to be accompanied by a follower or pupil for their protection.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're enrolled here as my follower,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so hold your head up high.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.59,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that. I'm grateful to you, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to be. Getting you in wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.96,0:03:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's only a three-year special exemption.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.33,0:03:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.54,0:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As a school, this place has rules,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but none of the normal social laws.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It may only be considered a "minor ritual in the Far East,"
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.79,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're a mage who survived the Holy Grail War.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.37,0:03:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Some here won't take kindly to that,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.09,0:03:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you let down your guard...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.37,0:03:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guard is down!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sherou!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luvia-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so impersonal!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.35,0:03:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not currently on the clock as her butler, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.39,0:03:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"Miss Luvia" is perfectly fine, Sherou!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.22,0:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so chummy with him!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Tohsaka...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.85,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are we classmates, we're also neighbors living in the same apartment building.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so inappropriate about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything about it is inappropriate!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.51,0:04:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.44,0:04:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try to get along with our classmates, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.89,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we only got the third floor of \Nthat building thanks to Luvia-san, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.67,0:04:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sherou!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.69,0:04:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it go to your head!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.57,0:04:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear! O-Oh, oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.53,0:04:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Change in plans!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next class will be...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Self-defense.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.13,0:04:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The class where one expresses one's vitality \Nthrough physical ability.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.95,0:04:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Edelfelt family's designated heir,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luviagelita Edelfelt,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.16,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,will provide you with a much-needed lesson.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.52,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be mistaken for a gorilla! Miss Gorilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, keep talking!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts! It hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with that new-money bitch?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.78,0:05:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I nailed her right in the medulla oblongata, so why wouldn't she go down?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.15,0:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Luvia-san isn't a bad person, so just—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.91,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you two meet, anyway?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.08,0:05:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not long after we moved here, we both got lost...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.11,0:05:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.77,0:06:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.22,0:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll settle things with her eventually.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what will you do?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.29,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You got an invitation, right? \NTo officially join the Mages' Association?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.33,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A mage's innate talents are evaluated and recorded, \Nalong with the nature of their soul.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They then become a mage affiliated with Clock Tower.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a good thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.75,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your activities would be restricted in some ways \Nbecause you'd basically be indebted to the Association.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.34,0:06:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But it comes with a lot of perks for a mage,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.14,0:06:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so most people would jump at it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.69,0:06:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.94,0:06:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming a Clock Tower member and a genuine mage...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the right decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.20,0:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But my beliefs lie elsewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.51,0:07:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I overslept. I'll start breakfast right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.35,0:07:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Emiya-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.43,0:07:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you go somewhere with me today?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.63,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.09,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Glastonbury.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A certain king's grave.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.17,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you regretted not getting the chance to say a proper goodbye that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.51,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you two some time alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.42,0:08:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot that you were a king, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.50,0:08:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.00,0:08:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,For what it's worth, I've come a long way since then.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure is a nice place.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.77,0:08:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels weird to think that, in a place like this, people once led lives nothing like ours.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.71,0:08:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like they say, it's a big old world.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.46,0:08:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been six months since we came to England.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.19,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, every day is one surprise after another.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.88,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned how insignificant I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.06,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I became a Master, fought alongside Saber,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and survived the Holy Grail War, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.61,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I could do anything if I put my mind to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.04,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But by the very next day, that arrogance had faded away.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You never change, Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.31,0:09:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Grail War was a major event.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.03,0:09:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I've seen a bit more of the world,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it's clear that it was only one event of many.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.39,0:09:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it left a significant mark
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and sowed the seeds of change.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not have personally matured,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.34,0:09:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but I just saw for myself how special that battle was.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the opposite.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.60,0:09:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to believe it wasn't anything special at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.95,0:09:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Grail War, Clock Tower, simple days like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.14,0:09:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never fundamentally change.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.39,0:09:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You relied on Saber,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.07,0:10:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but in her life, Saber herself relied on the people of the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all connected.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we walk through life \Nnot only on our own feet,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.41,0:10:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but also by standing on the shoulders \Nof those who came before.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock Tower is steeped in ancient traditions.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.80,0:10:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So every day, while I'm studying, \NI feel like someone is judging me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.51,0:10:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like they're asking what {\rDefault-Italic}my{\rDefault} contribution will be.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was that simple, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.32,0:10:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wake up, numbskull!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.09,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's already left for the assembly!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you boycotting it or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.28,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.06,0:11:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The closing assembly of our second year is about to start!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Issei...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.96,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things going on the mountain?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.21,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The rebuilding of the main hall just got underway.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.16,0:11:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's working hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.09,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Times such as these truly test a head priest's mettle.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.09,0:11:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, I'm barely even a novice...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.45,0:11:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's enough to make me want to \Nbow in gratitude to our parishioners.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll come by to help out soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.85,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, how is Shinji doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.67,0:11:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been in the hospital for quite some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be discharged any day now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.31,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura's been going to visit him daily.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.62,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, his little sister is checking in on him every day, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.45,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, from what I can see, she's worn Shinji down.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura's a tenacious girl,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's been browbeaten into letting her look after him.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.03,0:12:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful news.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the two kids I was looking for!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.16,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since anyone's heard from him,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.05,0:12:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and we have a new teacher starting next semester.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.15,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll look after Kuzuki-sensei's personal effects at the temple.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.14,0:12:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned up at the temple out of nowhere in the first place,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.52,0:12:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so I suppose it's fitting that he left us the same way.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.55,0:12:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't the student council president.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.15,0:12:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Already up and patrolling the school?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.00,0:12:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you doing maintenance on the club rooms?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.22,0:13:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I tire of saying it so often,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but you really are diligent that way, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.31,0:13:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've grown rather tired of our rote exchanges, myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.20,0:13:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not try guessing something new every once in a while?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.92,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you haven't been deliberately \Nrepeating yourself, have you, Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I have.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.37,0:13:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You never figured that out?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuudou-kun sure is uptight,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.08,0:13:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.38,0:13:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the meaning of this, Emiya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.16,0:13:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What manner of relationship are you in with this foul vixen?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, come get me in my classroom later, Emiya-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait until you get there.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.08,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.65,0:13:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, President!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.48,0:13:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mitsuzuri Ayako...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.77,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind explaining the new budget?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does my club's funding have to be slashed?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The archery club isn't the only one!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.61,0:14:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All club budgets have had to be reviewed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.21,0:14:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't buy it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll stand right there and explain yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.46,0:14:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Emiya-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you ever in the track club?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Track club?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.02,0:14:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was always in the archery club.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.77,0:14:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.23,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess these things happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking at the sunset, and it reminded me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.32,0:14:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to admit, it's flown by in a flash.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.53,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since the Holy Grail War ended \Nand you signed on as my pupil.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the next year will fly by.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.53,0:14:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After that happens, we'll be leaving this school behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.27,0:14:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do after graduation?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.96,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow in your father's footsteps?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah... Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.11,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,After I graduate, I'm going to London.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.66,0:15:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In light of everything that happened, \Nthe Mages' Association wrote me a letter of recommendation.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.55,0:15:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,London? The Mages' Association's headquarters?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That Clock Tower place?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.53,0:15:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been invited as the Tohsaka family heir.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.34,0:15:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They say I can bring a pupil with me if I like.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, does that mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.99,0:15:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.15,0:15:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you be doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.89,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. You always go right for my weak spot.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.75,0:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important, so give me a straight answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.71,0:15:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.79,0:15:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask when you already know the answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.04,0:15:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's keep up the good work, Emiya-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.02,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna whip you into shape until \Nyou're a proper mage, so brace yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.69,0:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My life's goal is to make you into a new man—\None who's happy through and through.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for bringing me with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.19,0:16:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.62,0:17:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the exchange student from Japan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that would be Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was referring to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.22,0:17:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from Fuyuki City in Japan, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.16,0:17:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to have the makings of a mage.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.87,0:17:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine you were an outsider who was caught up in the ritual and missed his chance to get out?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it puzzling.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.62,0:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After surviving that troublesome war,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.84,0:17:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to what end have you come to Clock Tower?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.92,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To what end do you study magic?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.85,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.79,0:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since coming here, I've learned many things,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.47,0:17:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and in many ways, I've been out of my depth.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.81,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to keep believing in what I believed in before.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.14,0:17:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to dedicate my life to that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.58,0:17:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning what, exactly?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.31,0:17:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I realize how dumb this sounds...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.31,0:17:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to become something.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.15,0:18:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A champion of justice.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.45,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That certainly is idiotic.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is nothing to laugh at.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A champion of justice, hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.70,0:18:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose such a man would find this place stifling.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.09,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.54,0:18:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we have plans for dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? What did you do about enrollment?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.93,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I turned them down.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not angry?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.99,0:18:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.67,0:18:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but if you aren't going to join Clock Tower,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.73,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means I'll be thrown out in three years too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that doesn't mean you have to—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it nonstop,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.38,0:19:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think I'll ever be able to change how I live.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.79,0:19:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I know I'm not right, I can't change paths.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.89,0:19:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as he said...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll meet the same fate.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.75,0:19:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. I agree with him there.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're full of mistakes, Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.98,0:19:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably on the same path, \Nheading in the same direction.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.29,0:19:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference might be in how far you can go.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.64,0:19:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What matters is where you end up, \Nand how far you came, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.15,0:19:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if your destination \Nand the result end up being the same,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.42,0:19:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,if you manage to walk a little further afterward,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.48,0:19:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll get your proper ending.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.43,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope it turns out like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.14,0:20:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I guess hoping isn't enough. \NI need to make sure that's what happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.34,0:20:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.89,0:20:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've had your answer all along.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you really sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.96,0:20:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock Tower is an important place to you, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.53,0:20:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I'll probably settle down at Clock Tower.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.16,0:20:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to look around and get things out of my system.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, see the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.54,0:20:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So now it's my turn to drag you around with me, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, though that's all a ways off yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.20,0:20:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, having fun, suffering, seeing the sights,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.80,0:20:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually having our own happily ever after...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the future in store for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.29,0:22:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy once said,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.81,0:22:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't want to watch people die."
Dialogue: 10,0:22:46.74,0:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shouldn't it be possible to save all who suffer?"
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.29,0:22:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the boy was trying to cut down was himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.93,0:23:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He wielded his sword for what he came to believe in.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.31,0:23:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no longer a path where his battle ends and he turns back.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.15,0:23:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he did get his answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.05,0:23:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He has regrets.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.57,0:23:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't know how many times \Nhe has wished to do it all over.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.53,0:23:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This fate is set in stone,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.91,0:23:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and Emiya will probably go on cursing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But even still,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.33,0:23:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not wrong.
Comment: 10,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{ED}

